#### 6. No Input Validation / Sanitization (OWASP A03)

There is no body parser or input validation. When POST/PUT routes are added (and they will be), unsanitized input is the #1 source of injection, XSS, and logic bypass bugs.

**Fix — add `express-validator` from day one:**
```js
