#### 7. No HTTPS Enforcement (OWASP A02, A05)

The server listens on plain HTTP with no redirect or HSTS enforcement. Credentials and tokens sent over HTTP are trivially intercepted.

**Fix — enforce HTTPS and HSTS:**
