#### 6. No Request Body Parsing or Input Validation (OWASP A03 – Injection)

`express.json()` and `express.urlencoded()` are not configured, so POST/PUT bodies are silently ignored. When body parsing is eventually added without validation, it opens the door to injection and unexpected data shapes.

