### 🔴 Finding 3 — No Authentication or Authorization (OWASP A07)

**Problem:** `/users` returns all user data to anyone — no token, session, or API key required. Any anonymous caller on the internet can access it.

**Fix:** Add JWT-based authentication middleware:

```bash
