### 8. No Request Logging / Audit Trail (OWASP A09 – Security Logging & Monitoring Failures)

**Problem:** There is no request logging. Without it, detecting attacks, investigating incidents, or meeting compliance requirements (SOC 2, GDPR, HIPAA) is impossible.

**Fix:**

```js
// ✅ Install: npm install morgan
