### 10. Port Hardcoded; No Graceful Shutdown (OWASP A05 – Security Misconfiguration)

**Problem:** Port `3000` is hardcoded. More importantly, there is no graceful shutdown handler — abrupt termination can leave connections in a dirty state, cause data loss, or prevent log flushing.

```js
