**Problem:** The health endpoint exposes a precise server-side timestamp. Alone this is low risk, but combined with other data it aids fingerprinting and timing attacks. More importantly, health endpoints frequently expand over time to include version numbers, dependency states, and environment data — all useful to attackers.

