## Finding 7 — 🟠 Hardcoded Port & Missing Environment Config (OWASP A05)

**Problem:** Port `3000` is hardcoded. More critically, there is no evidence of any `.env` / `dotenv` usage, which means secrets (DB credentials, JWT keys, API keys) will likely end up hardcoded in source code.

**Fix:** Use environment variables for all configuration.

```bash
npm install dotenv
