### 4. No CORS Policy (OWASP A05 – Security Misconfiguration)

**Problem:** Without explicit CORS configuration, browser behaviour is unpredictable across environments. When a CORS policy is eventually needed, it is easy to accidentally set `origin: '*'` — which allows any website to make credentialed requests to your API.

**Fix:**

