For any production system, `.env` files are the lowest tier of secret management. The progression of options is:

```
.env files          ← least secure, never in production
      ↓
Platform env vars   ← better (Heroku, Render, Railway config vars)
      ↓
Secrets managers    ← correct for production
(AWS Secrets Manager, HashiCorp Vault, GCP Secret Manager, Azure Key Vault)
