### 4. No CORS Policy — Cross-Origin Data Theft

**The problem:** Without an explicit CORS policy, Express's default behavior is permissive in ways that vary by deployment environment. Any website could potentially make credentialed requests to this API in some configurations. This maps to **OWASP A01 – Broken Access Control**.

