**The problem:** The app listens on plain HTTP port 3000. Credentials and PII sent over HTTP are exposed to network interception. **OWASP A02:2021 – Cryptographic Failures**.

**Fix:** In production, terminate TLS at a reverse proxy (nginx/load balancer) and enforce HTTPS in-app:

