The application is a minimal Express.js server. While it doesn't contain *actively exploitable* code today (e.g., no SQL queries, no auth logic), it is **missing nearly every security baseline** required for a production service. The vulnerabilities below are all **real risks** — several are day-one exploitable the moment the app grows, and a few are exploitable right now.

