The current `app.js` has **no secrets at all**, which is consistent with it being a skeleton. Before adding any credentials (DB, JWT, third-party APIs), set up the secrets infrastructure **first** using the tiers above, starting with at minimum a `.env` + `.gitignore` pattern locally and a proper secrets manager for any deployed environment.

