### 2. Hardcoded PII / Static Data Exposed Directly in Route Handler
**OWASP A02 – Cryptographic Failures / A04 – Insecure Design**

User data (names and email addresses) is hardcoded directly in the route. In a real app this pattern leads to either real credentials being committed to source control, or business logic bypasses.

```js
